(text "C2: place at U5 VDD/GND" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 144.78 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cc15e19d-2146-475d-8ddb-ae00b7bf9027"))
(text "OPTION B NOTES\n- PCM5102A: SCK to GND (internal PLL), XSMT high (unmute), FMT low (I2S), FLT/DEMP low.\n  If the solder jumpers on the back (H1L-H4L) are already set the same way, the header wires are harmless.\n- PCM5102A pin order shown is the common purple board. Check your silkscreen.\n- MAX98306 inputs are differential: L+ from LOUT, L- to GND. Unused R+/R- grounded.\n- Gain: set 6 dB with the board's gain jumper (PCM5102A line out is hot).\n- SD is driven by AMP_SD (GPIO12): firmware must drive it HIGH to enable the amp.\n- One speaker on the left channel. Outputs are bridge-tied: never connect them to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 144.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a8d05998-cc34-4158-bec0-2a6238447b8d"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
